            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Bouncebin 1.0.5</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Buttons that open a file chooser now work in the app. <b>Import
      database</b> and <b>Choose cover</b> did nothing at all when clicked
      &#8212; the window was quietly ignoring every file picker.</li>
  <li>The same was true of anything that asks a question: naming a playlist,
      renaming one, and the confirmations before deleting a playlist or
      overwriting ratings. All of them work now.</li>
  <li>Renamed to <b>Export database</b> and <b>Import database</b>.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
